#===========================================================

- title: File drop in startup folder
  description: Drop a file in the windows startup folder,
    in order to achieve execution on startup. Commonly
    used by lower-quality malware for persistence.
  category: [persistence, file]
  author: emryll
  score: 35

  components:
    - type: file
      action: create
      conditions:
        dir:
          - "%appdata%/Roaming/Microsoft/Windows/Start Menu/Programs/Startup"

  response: alert("New startup entry detected!")

#===========================================================

